    "review": "Official C145 schematic and Tab5 manual give one shared P4/expander/audio/SD wiring map for all three published panel assemblies. The pinned BSP supplies distinct panel timings/init and GPIO23 handling, selected by the touch controller. Unknown panel firmware fails closed. No factory-binary pin inference used. INA226 0x41/5 mOhm shunt, BMI270 0x68 and RX8130CE 0x32 use the same published shared I2C1 map; identity and configuration readback precede telemetry. The RTC backup control matches the fitted rechargeable supply. Charger/rail controls stay excluded.",
